{"id":"440055","name":"肉丁海参疙瘩汤","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/440055/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肉","amount":"30克"},{"name":"葱","amount":"小许"},{"name":"姜","amount":"小许"},{"name":"菠菜","amount":"50克"},{"name":"海参","amount":"1个"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"50克"},{"name":"清水","amount":"300克"},{"name":"花生油","amount":"3克"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"0.5克"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"5克"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪肉，胡萝卜，葱姜都改刀。","img":"images/440055/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"菠菜洗净茎叶分开。","img":"images/440055/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"热锅冷油，放食盐。","img":"images/440055/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放猪肉胡萝卜和葱姜翻炒。","img":"images/440055/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放生抽。","img":"images/440055/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放菠菜梗。","img":"images/440055/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"海参切圈。","img":"images/440055/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放海参翻炒均匀。","img":"images/440055/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加清水，盖锅盖中火烧煮。","img":"images/440055/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取面粉。","img":"images/440055/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放小许清水。","img":"images/440055/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"搓成面疙瘩。","img":"images/440055/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"汤汁开锅。","img":"images/440055/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放上面疙瘩，煮开。","img":"images/440055/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放入菠菜叶，烫熟立马捞出。","img":"images/440055/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放鸡精提味。","img":"images/440055/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/440055/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/440055/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/440055/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/440055/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"开动。","img":"images/440055/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}